From e600f5ed220270cc20f36b588a6059a1228b806b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Triston Armstrong <tarmstrong95@proton.me>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 22:57:45 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] drm: apple: remove VRR bring-up debug scaffolding

Drop the temporary module parameters, verbose logging, and timestamp
experimentation added while reverse-engineering the DCP adaptive-sync
path. Keep the functional changes: capability advertisement, live
Adaptive Sync application in the flush path, the synthetic panel EDID,
and the minimum-frequency provider property (now a named constant).
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/apple/apple_drv.c      |   4 +-
 drivers/gpu/drm/apple/dcp-internal.h   |   9 +-
 drivers/gpu/drm/apple/dcp.c            |  49 +-------
 drivers/gpu/drm/apple/iomfb.c          |   1 -
 drivers/gpu/drm/apple/iomfb_template.c | 162 ++-----------------------
 5 files changed, 26 insertions(+), 199 deletions(-)

